 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Yeelen" href="/whats-on/yeelen" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Yeelen</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>In Cissé’s spellbinding fantasy, a young man with magical powers journeys to his uncle to request help in fighting his evil sorcerer father.</p>
  </div>
