 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Young Soul Rebels" href="/whats-on/young-soul-rebels" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Young Soul Rebels</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Isaac Julien’s feature debut sees two young Black men reckon with the death of a close friend while pursuing their dreams in 1970s East London.</p>
  </div>
